  "label": "The baby is mapped as the survivor",
  "description": "The text 'i made it out alive' is mapped onto the newborn baby, implying that the baby is the 'i' (the survivor) who narrowly escaped harm. The visual of the sleeping, peaceful baby is used to represent the survivor who 'made it out alive' due to the intervention or non-action of 'the democrats'. This mapping uses the baby's vulnerability and calm state to symbolize the survivor's relief and narrow escape.",
